  "description": "A dynaset over T with its Fields collection and Field N held is closed. After the Close, each of AbsolutePosition, BOF, Bookmark, Bookmarkable, CacheSize, EditMode, EOF, Filter, Index, LastModified, LockEdits, Name, NoMatch, PercentPosition, RecordCount, Restartable, Sort, Type, Updatable and Fields is read by its own call, and Count of the held Fields, Value, Name of the held Field are read; then MoveFirst, MoveNext, Clone, Requery, GetRows, OpenRecordset, FindFirst \"ID = 1\", AddNew, Update, CancelUpdate and Close are called; Errors read after the reads and after the calls. Asks which members of a closed Recordset still answer and which refuse, and with what. The fixture copy is opened read-only.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
